  "content": "<h2>Handycam 添加了微妙且基于物理的相机动作，讓 Minecraft 感覺像是用真實的手持相機拍攝的。</h2>\n<h2>效果</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>步行搖擺</li>\n<li> Sprint 搖擺</li>\n<li>Strafe 傾斜</li>\n<li>前傾</li>\n<li>Mouse lead</li>\n<li>Idle 震動</li>\n<li>呼吸</li>\n<li>Damage 震動</li>\n<li>Hit 衝擊</li>\n<li>Bow shot 後坐力</li>\n<li>Jump 震動</li>\n<li>Landing 衝擊</li>\n<li>Crouch 震動</li>\n<li>Eat 搖擺</li>\n<li>爆炸</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>設定</h2>\n<p>每個效果都有獨立的強度滑塊，可以單獨關閉。通過 <strong>ModMenu</strong> (Fabric) 或遊戲內 mod 菜單（NeoForge）打開設置。</p>\n<h2>依賴</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> <em>(僅適用於 Fabric)</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> <em>(僅適用於 Fabric)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>僅限客户端。在任何服務器上使用都安全。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandycam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/vercim/handycam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"cloth-config-api\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric-api\"></a></p>",
